      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, you didn't actually give me the pros and cons for staying neutral. u just kinda said why supporting it is better and why neutral is bad. \n\ncan u actually give me a balanced list of the risks of staying neutral? like, besides people being mad, what are the actual business/PR downsides of not taking a side?",
